      "sizesAndBackgrounds": "Inspect all four at logical size and enlarged; light, neutral gray and dark backgrounds expose alpha/material defects. Contact sheets may contain each exact verified native frame without hidden per-view fitting or grading.",
      "contactAndScale": "Proportionate four-facing sheet plus repeated/nearby column footprint contact and related scale preview. Source has no sockets/ports: evaluate grounding, occupancy, occlusion and functional spacing rather than invented modular joins.",
      "actualConsumer": "Browser dev4178 #object-column-broken SpriteScene with shared native-world-raster path, hash-bound candidate URLs, all four facings and repeated/interaction context. Inspect phone/landscape/desktop readable framing as applicable; no unused Godot bench or shipping claim.",
      "technical": "Validate root matrices, physical bounds, source camera matrices, resolution/pixel aspect, facing rotation followed by footing transform, no raster model substitutes, no links or packed resource gaps, no clipping and relocated exact native RGBA replay across all four views."
